 REXWS  [4 ws - 3 live]                         
------------------------------------------------
 +- Help -------------------------------------+ 
 |  Markers                                   | 
 |  > selected    * active window             | 
 |  >v collapsed/expanded                     | 
 |  > context  ? unknown  - none              | 
 |  !   ambiguous session binding             | 
 |  ||   live updates paused for this session | 
 |  !|  both                                  | 
 |  x   dismiss the newest action error       | 
 |  Keys                                      | 
 |  j/k, v/^     move selection               | 
 |  >/l          expand / first child         | 
 |  </h          back / collapse              | 
 |  space enter  toggle / switch              | 
 |  s n d r  status/new/remove/refresh        | 
 |  c  cleanup                                | 
 |  / ? q        search / help / quit         | 
 |  PgUp/PgDn    move one page                | 
 |  ctrl+u       clear query                  | 
 |  ctrl+n/p     move selection               | 
 |  ctrl+c       quit                         | 
 |  esc          clear filter / close modal   | 
